# ==============================================================================
# RAMA VASAVI PORTFOLIO - CONTACT FORM CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# Choose either Option 1 (Formspree - Recommended) OR Option 2 (EmailJS).
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your value.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: Formspree (Easiest - 1 minute setup)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Go to https://formspree.io and sign in with your email: Vasavi0908@gmail.com
# 2. Click "+ New Form", give it a name (e.g. "Portfolio Contact")
# 3. Formspree will provide a Form ID (e.g. "mrbzgkve") or an endpoint URL
# 4. Paste your Form ID or full endpoint below:
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=your_formspree_id_here
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_formspree_id_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: EmailJS (Alternative)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add Email Service (Connect your Gmail: Vasavi0908@gmail.com)
# 3. Create an Email Template with fields: {{name}}, {{email}}, {{message}}
#    and set Reply-To to {{email}}
# 4. Paste your Service ID, Template ID, and Public Key below:
# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
# VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
